# Attribution

Pixi VSCode (`munch-group/pixi-vscode`) is a fork of **Pixi Code**:

- Project: https://github.com/renan-r-santos/pixi-code
- Author: Renan Santos (https://github.com/renan-r-santos)
- License: MIT
- Forked from: commit `996c368` (release `v0.2.0`)

The entire initial codebase was written by Renan Santos and is imported
unmodified in the first commit of this repository, so the provenance of every
subsequent change is visible in `git log`. All credit for the original design
and implementation belongs to the upstream author.

The architecture has since diverged: this extension no longer implements the
Python Environments extension's `EnvironmentManager` interface, and drives the
Python extension's own API instead. These modules remain substantially
upstream's work:

- `src/common/deferred.ts`
- `src/common/findPython.ts`
- `src/common/persistentState.ts`
- `assets/`

The upstream repository is configured as the `upstream` git remote:

```bash
git fetch upstream
git diff HEAD upstream/main -- src/
```

